msgid "If a site blocks curl/browser automation (403 / JS-heavy)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/summarize_SKILL.md:59
msgid ""
"Some sites (including openai.com articles) may return 403 to "
"`curl`/`wget`, and in some sandboxed environments the browser runner may "
"fail to launch (Chrome sandbox / userns restrictions)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/summarize_SKILL.md:61
msgid "Fast fallback (no JS): use the `r.jina.ai` text-render proxy:"
msgstr ""

